1
00:00:00,031 --> 00:00:02,451
(Sheldon:)You're not done with her, are you?

2
00:00:03,451 --> 00:00:06,541
(Leonard:)Our babies will be smart and beautiful.

3
00:00:08,415 --> 00:00:10,875
(Sheldon:)Not to mention imaginary.

4
00:00:16,798 --> 00:00:18,718
- Is Thai food okay with you, Penny?
- Sure.

5
00:00:18,883 --> 00:00:20,883
(Sheldon:)We can't have Thai,
we had Indian for lunch.

6
00:00:21,052 --> 00:00:23,472
(Leonard:)- So?
- They're both curry-based cuisines.

7
00:00:23,638 --> 00:00:26,348
(Leonard:)- So?
- It would be gastronomically redundant.

8
00:00:26,516 --> 00:00:29,936
(Sheldon:)I can see we're going to have to
spell out everything for this girl.

9
00:00:30,729 --> 00:00:32,769
(Penny:)Any ideas, Raj?

10
00:00:34,399 --> 00:00:36,649
(Howard:)Turn left on Lake Street
and head up to Colorado.

11
00:00:36,818 --> 00:00:39,448
(Howard:)I know a wonderful little sushi bar
that has karaoke.

12
00:00:39,612 --> 00:00:41,572
Oh, that sounds like fun.

13
00:00:42,032 --> 00:00:47,032
[SINGING]
Baby, baby, don't get hooked on me

14
00:00:47,662 --> 00:00:53,462
Oh, baby, baby
Don't get hooked on me

15
00:00:54,085 --> 00:00:56,425
I don't know your odds
in the world as a whole...

16
00:00:56,588 --> 00:01:00,888
(Sheldon:)...but as far as the population of this car
goes, you're a veritable mac daddy.

17
00:01:01,176 --> 00:01:04,306
(Howard(sings):)Baby, don't get hooked on me

